herdr-dagr's CONTRACT.md (contract v3) and lists only the fields pod writes.

OpenRig
https://github.com/mvschwarz/openrig
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

pod borrows design ideas, not code, from OpenRig: required closure reasons on a
finished attempt, paste-confirm-Enter input into agent panes, the store-derived
wake ladder, the three-axis activity taxonomy, and the escalation routing rule
(route a blocker to its owner, and reach a person once with evidence and a
default). Thanks to the Orca and OpenRig authors.
